      "type": "text",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 120,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "The analyse / publish split is the trust boundary. The analyse job runs the repository's own build logic and holds no credential;\nthe publish job holds the credential and runs none of the repository's code. Collapsing them puts a publish credential on a runner\nexecuting repository-controlled code, which is remote code execution by design.",
      "originalText": "The analyse / publish split is the trust boundary. The analyse job runs the repository's own build logic and holds no credential;\nthe publish job holds the credential and runs none of the repository's code. Collapsing them puts a publish credential on a runner\nexecuting repository-controlled code, which is remote code execution by design.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 10
    },
